Workflow:
  Real chromatograms
  - data/<Molecule>/<stem>.txt from Steven
  - <stem>.txt --> <stem>_bl.txt, plots and r2 plots (tools/loop_bl.sbatch)
    - check the baseline corrections: tools/merger.sh <run> sets each
      r2 plot beside its chromatogram
  - <stem>_bl.txt --> <stem>_bl_<mol>.csv, one per signal
      (tools/loop_extract.sh DIR X0 X1 MOL [PATTERN])
  - all peak .csv --> solvent_effect_data.csv (tools/data_aggregator.py)
  - stats for each species (tools/stats_analysis.py)

  Synthetic benchmark
  - tools/synthetic/synth_dataset.py DATASET --family erb --replicates 12
  - sweep, scoring and review figures:
      MODE=synth DATASET=... sbatch tools/loop_bl.sbatch
  - merged figures: tools/merger.sh <run>
  - sorted merged figures: tools/fcut/figures/potential/qo_all.py
      --run <run> --dataset DATASET --out MERGED/MERGED_<run>
